[I] Command line arguments parser for C++11 and later

[T] docopt.cpp is a C++11 port of docopt, which builds a command line
[T] argument parser from the usage and help message text written by the
[T] programmer. The parsed options are returned as a map of values instead
[T] of requiring hand-written parsing code.

[U] https://github.com/docopt/docopt.cpp/

[A] Docopt Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

